 tests/001_Geometry.phpt  | 86 ++++++++++++++++++++--------------------
 tests/002_WKTWriter.phpt | 24 ++++++-----
 tests/004_WKBWriter.phpt | 14 ++++---
 tests/005_WKBReader.phpt |  6 +--
 5 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 61 deletions(-)

